	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Nihil habeo, quod iis nunc addam, quę proxime per <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>matrem scripsi, nisi quod constans fama affertur <lb xml:id="p1z3"/><placeName ref="l2235">Caletem</placeName> per <placeName ref="l830">Anglos</placeName> <placeName ref="l832">Gallis</placeName> denuo esse ereptam, <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>quae tibi mox communicare volui, quamvis existimem <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>te certiora habere.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Expecto quoque, quid de his et aliis <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>nobis scribas.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Ego nunc venio a domino <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>de <placeName>Habspurg</placeName>, qui praefectum agit marchionis <placeName ref="l2978">Badensis</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>in dominio <placeName>Rotulano</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Is privignam <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>desponsavit cuidam nobili apud nos de familia <placeName>Er<lb xml:id="p1z10"/>lacensi</placeName> eamque huc deduxit.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Expetivit is meum <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>colloquium et multa mecum contulit (ut est vir prudens <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>et doctus) de rebus ecclesiasticis, praesertim de sacramen<lb xml:id="p1z13"/>taria contentione.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Cupit eam sublatam; <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>mult de colloquio instituendo proposuit.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Video eum <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>Lutheranae esse sententiae, sic tamen ut neminem <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>condemnare velit; totus pendet a <persName ref="p3099">Sulcero</persName>.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Ostendit, <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>quomodo se in comitiis aliquot semper opposuerit illis, qui <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>nostras vellent damnare ecclesias.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Ego illum hortatu<lb xml:id="p1z19"/>s, ut deinceps idem facere et nos <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>a calumniis improborum <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>defendere velit et saltem hoc efficere, ut <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>ipsorum pars eadem modestia contra nos utatur, qua nos <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>contra illos.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Promisit multa.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Inter alia rogavit, <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>ut, si quando ad te scriberem, rogarem, ut ad collo<lb xml:id="p1z25"/>quium, si evoceris, tuam operam non deneges.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Ego illi multa q<lb xml:id="p1z26"/>uoque de colloquiorum periculis dixi et de studio <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>ecclesiae <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinae</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>quoque in retinenda pace, quę ille <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>non improbavit.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z30"/>Ubiquitatem reiicit; <persName ref="p7024">Westphalo</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>infensus est pro<lb xml:id="p1z32"/>pter excitatam denuo tragoediam et to<lb xml:id="p1z33"/>tus huc propendet, ut <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>invicem pax servetur, <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>do<lb xml:id="p1z36"/>nec dominus meliora <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>concedat.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Sperat fore, ut <lb xml:id="p1z38"/>d. <persName ref="p4183">Iacobus Andreae</persName> <placeName ref="l195">Ge<lb xml:id="p1z39"/>ppingensis</placeName> <placeName ref="l587">Tigurum</placeName> veniat et <lb xml:id="p1z40"/>tecum de his rebus confer<lb xml:id="p1z41"/>at.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Cuius te praemonere <lb xml:id="p1z42"/>volui, quamvis certo nesciat, an futurum sit necne.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z43"/>Ego <lb xml:id="p1z44"/>nunc iterum ad eum redeo cum eo pransurus, e<lb xml:id="p1z45"/>t cum commode hic se mihi offerret, haec effundere potius <lb xml:id="p1z46"/>quam scribere ad te volui.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Boni itaque consule.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell"><lb xml:id="p1z47"/>Bene vale.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l41">Bernę</placeName> 10. iunii 1560.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z48"/><persName ref="p8018">I[o]<lb xml:id="p1z49"/>h[annes] H[alleru<pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>s]</persName> tuus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">Clarissimo viro d. <persName ref="p495">Heinr<lb xml:id="p2z2"/>ycho Bullingero</persName>, <lb xml:id="p2z3"/><placeName ref="l587">Tigurinae</placeName> ecclesiae antistiti fide<lb xml:id="p2z4"/>lissimo, domino et compatri suo <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>colendissimo.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
